  .pay[aria-disabled="true"]{opacity:.65;cursor:not-allowed;}
  .summary{margin:1rem 0;padding:1rem;border:2px solid var(--error);border-radius:4px;}
  .summary h2{margin:0 0 .5rem;font-size:1.125rem;}
  .summary a{color:var(--error);}
  dialog{max-width:26rem;padding:1.5rem;border:2px solid var(--brand-ink);border-radius:8px;}
  dialog::backdrop{background:rgb(0 0 0 / .55);}
  dialog .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1rem;}
  dialog .pay{width:auto;padding:0 1.25rem;margin:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;}
  .vh{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="timer" id="timer-bar" role="region" aria-label="좌석 선점 시간">
  <span>좌석 선점 남은 시간 <span id="t" role="timer">10:00</span></span>
  <button type="button" class="btn-sec" id="extend-inline">시간 연장</button>
</div>
<div id="live" class="vh" aria-live="polite"></div>

<main>
  <h1>예매자 정보</h1>
  <p class="hint">모든 항목은 필수이며, 선택 항목은 따로 표시했습니다.</p>

  <div id="error-summary" class="summary" tabindex="-1" hidden>
    <h2>입력 내용을 확인해 주세요</h2>
    <ul id="error-list"></ul>
  </div>

  <form id="order" novalidate>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="name">이름</label>
      <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required aria-describedby="name-err">
      <p id="name-err" class="field-err"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="email">이메일</label>
      <input id="email" name="email" type="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email"
             autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" required
             aria-describedby="email-hint email-err">
      <p id="email-hint" class="hint">모바일 티켓이 이 주소로 발송됩니다.</p>
      <p id="email-err" class="field-err"></p>
      <div id="email-suggest" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="phone">휴대폰 번호 <span class="opt">(선택)</span></label>
      <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel"
             aria-describedby="phone-hint phone-err">
      <p id="phone-hint" class="hint">해외 번호는 +로 시작해 주세요. 예: +49 151 1234567</p>
      <p id="phone-err" class="field-err"></p>
    </div>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>결제 카드</legend>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="card">카드 번호</label>
        <input id="card" name="card" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="cc-number"
               required aria-describedby="card-hint card-err">
        <p id="card-hint" class="hint">숫자만 입력하면 4자리씩 자동으로 띄어집니다.</p>
        <p id="card-err" class="field-err"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="exp">유효기간 (MM/YY)</label>
          <input id="exp" name="exp" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="cc-exp"
                 maxlength="5" required aria-describedby="exp-err">
          <p id="exp-err" class="field-err"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="cvc">CVC</label>
          <input id="cvc" name="cvc" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="cc-csc"
                 maxlength="4" required aria-describedby="cvc-hint cvc-err">
          <p id="cvc-hint" class="hint">카드 뒷면 3자리 (아멕스는 앞면 4자리)</p>
          <p id="cvc-err" class="field-err"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="captcha">보안문자</label>
      <p id="captcha-hint" class="hint">이미지 속 문자를 입력하세요. 대소문자는 구분하지 않습니다. 이미지가 잘 보이지 않으면 '음성으로 듣기'를 누르세요.</p>
      <div class="captcha">
        <img id="captcha-img" src="captcha.png" alt="보안문자 이미지 (자동 입력 방지용)" width="160" height="50">
        <button type="button" class="btn-sec" id="captcha-audio-btn">음성으로 듣기</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-sec" id="captcha-refresh">새 문자 받기</button>
      </div>
      <audio id="captcha-audio" src="captcha-audio.mp3" preload="none"></audio>
